TiddlyWiki 5.3.8 (empty.html)

Source: https://tiddlywiki.com/empty.html (downloaded 2026-08-07)

This is the official pre-built empty TiddlyWiki, vendored so that export
needs no Node.js at runtime. To upgrade: download a newer empty.html from
tiddlywiki.com, replace this file, update this note, and re-run the
export test suite (clj-ts.export.tiddlywiki-test exercises the splice
against this file).
